- lib/articles.ts: 3 curated articles summarized from real สบส./government
  news coverage (hcpr.hss.moph.go.th, bangkokbiznews citing สบส., Thai PBS
  citing สบส.+อย.), each with a citation box linking to the original source
- app/articles/page.tsx: listing page (featured + grid), matches existing
  Tailwind design tokens
- app/articles/[slug]/page.tsx: statically generated detail page per article
  with source attribution and a legal-advice disclaimer
- components/Nav.tsx: flip บทความ menu item from disabled (href: null) to
  /articles, per the existing TODO comment

Verified with tsc --noEmit and next build (full production build, all
routes including the 3 static /articles/[slug] pages compiled successfully).
